                    "body": "Sorry to hear that.\r\n\r\nI honestly (after reading several times through README and docs) don't understand how this can even work in a normal setting. Here, in 'mini.test', it is more like calling code in separate child processes, so even more hard. Maybe adding `require('luacov')` in 'minimal_init.lua' of child process can make it work?",
