                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> Does `mini.test` spawn child process by default?\r\nNo, it doesn't.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nNot sure, maybe it has something to do with the fact that 'mini.test' doesn't actually run tests when they are sourced. It first collects them in a special table and then executes its content.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Does <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.test</code> spawn child process by default?<br>\nNo, it doesn't.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Not sure, maybe it has something to do with the fact that 'mini.test' doesn't actually run tests when they are sourced. It first collects them in a special table and then executes its content.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Does mini.test spawn child process by default?\nNo, it doesn't.\n\n\nNot sure, maybe it has something to do with the fact that 'mini.test' doesn't actually run tests when they are sourced. It first collects them in a special table and then executes its content.",
